<title>RUSSIA: Russia to merge Svyazinvest, Rostelekom - Interfax.</title>
<headline>Russia to merge Svyazinvest, Rostelekom - Interfax.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia is planning to merge national telecoms group Rostelekom  with telecoms holding company AO Svyazinvest, Interfax news agency quoted privatisation minister Alfred Kokh as saying on Thursday.</p>
<p>Following the merger a &quot;significant stake&quot; in the new company would be sold, raising $1-2 billion, it quoted him as saying at a cabinet meeting.</p>
</text>
